{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type PowerSyncCollectionConfig<TTable, TSchema> = BasePowerSyncCollectionConfig<TTable, TSchema> & \n  | ConfigWithSQLiteTypes\n  | ConfigWithSQLiteInputType<TTable, TSchema>\n| ConfigWithArbitraryCollectionTypes<TTable, TSchema>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/powersync-db-collection/src/definitions.ts#L266","children":[{"type":"text","value":"definitions.ts:266"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Configuration options for creating a PowerSync collection."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"ttable","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TTable"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TTable"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Table"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Table"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tschema","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TSchema"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSchema"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"StandardSchemaV1"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"any"},{"type":"text","value":"> = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"never"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const APP_SCHEMA = new Schema({\n  documents: new Table({\n    name: column.text,\n  }),\n})\n\nconst db = new PowerSyncDatabase({\n  database: {\n    dbFilename: \"test.sqlite\",\n  },\n  schema: APP_SCHEMA,\n})\n\nconst collection = createCollection(\n  powerSyncCollectionOptions({\n    database: db,\n    table: APP_SCHEMA.props.documents\n  })\n)","lang":"typescript"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"ttable","text":"TTable","level":3},{"id":"tschema","text":"TSchema","level":3},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype PowerSyncCollectionConfig<TTable, TSchema> = BasePowerSyncCollectionConfig<TTable, TSchema> & \n  | ConfigWithSQLiteTypes\n  | ConfigWithSQLiteInputType<TTable, TSchema>\n| ConfigWithArbitraryCollectionTypes<TTable, TSchema>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [definitions.ts:266](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/powersync-db-collection/src/definitions.ts#L266)\n\nConfiguration options for creating a PowerSync collection.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TTable\n\n`TTable` *extends* `Table` = `Table`\n\n### TSchema\n\n`TSchema` *extends* `StandardSchemaV1`\\<`any`\\> = `never`\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nconst APP_SCHEMA = new Schema({\n  documents: new Table({\n    name: column.text,\n  }),\n})\n\nconst db = new PowerSyncDatabase({\n  database: {\n    dbFilename: \"test.sqlite\",\n  },\n  schema: APP_SCHEMA,\n})\n\nconst collection = createCollection(\n  powerSyncCollectionOptions({\n    database: db,\n    table: APP_SCHEMA.props.documents\n  })\n)\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: PowerSyncCollectionConfig\ntitle: PowerSyncCollectionConfig\n---\n\n```ts\ntype PowerSyncCollectionConfig<TTable, TSchema> = BasePowerSyncCollectionConfig<TTable, TSchema> & \n  | ConfigWithSQLiteTypes\n  | ConfigWithSQLiteInputType<TTable, TSchema>\n| ConfigWithArbitraryCollectionTypes<TTable, TSchema>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [definitions.ts:266](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/powersync-db-collection/src/definitions.ts#L266)\n\nConfiguration options for creating a PowerSync collection.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TTable\n\n`TTable` *extends* `Table` = `Table`\n\n### TSchema\n\n`TSchema` *extends* `StandardSchemaV1`\\<`any`\\> = `never`\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nconst APP_SCHEMA = new Schema({\n  documents: new Table({\n    name: column.text,\n  }),\n})\n\nconst db = new PowerSyncDatabase({\n  database: {\n    dbFilename: \"test.sqlite\",\n  },\n  schema: APP_SCHEMA,\n})\n\nconst collection = createCollection(\n  powerSyncCollectionOptions({\n    database: db,\n    table: APP_SCHEMA.props.documents\n  })\n)\n```\n"}
